,{"type":"math","value":"(U_{1},\\gamma_{1})"},{"type":"text","value":" , 下列说法正确的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/c7f82c39e3d911fc1fc9eee0e4379ec14d11a0b8c351ac40e708391d28f615c4.png","width":296,"height":367,"width_mm":34.65,"row_group":"gaosan-jinhua-shixiao-2411-q13-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n甲\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/1b8558ba5e8a0f9c06142a6bdb0807be87185c3253b50ed6f6996ff18f9e985a.png","width":333,"height":226,"width_mm":39.06,"row_group":"gaosan-jinhua-shixiao-2411-q13-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n乙\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 普朗克常量等于k"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. D点条件下形成的光电流一定比C点条件下形成的光电流大"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 满足D点条件的光电子到达A极的最大动能为 "},{"type":"math","value":"U_{1}e+\\frac{e}{k}(\\gamma_{1}-\\gamma_{0})"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 在光照强度相同的情况下, 沿直线从 A 到 D, 灵敏电流计示数一定逐渐变大"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"C","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-jinhua-shixiao-2411-q14","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-jinhua-shixiao-2411","source_question_id":"gaosan-jinhua-shixiao-2411-q14","number":"14","order":14,"type":"多选题","topics":["热学","光学","近代物理"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"4adc5e2db0fe633b44730c66b4a437a304495912aa4fdc6ec7beff6448f4ef5b","body":[{"type":"text","value":"14. 下列说法正确的是\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 黑体辐射电磁波的强度随波长的分布仅与黑体的温度有关"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 强子是参与强相互作用的粒子, 因而质子、中子和电子都属于强子"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 液晶具有旋光性, 加电场时偏振光被液晶层旋光呈现亮态"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 物理学中, 反映宏观自然过程的方向性的定律就是热力学第二定律"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"AD","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-jinhua-shixiao-2411-q15","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-jinhua-shixiao-2411","source_question_id":"gaosan-jinhua-shixiao-2411-q15","number":"15","order":15,"type":"多选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"9a96d833d9ed5a20ec7d11be3820a1712675c7c424f4aea6f30df6e180e53c38","body":[{"type":"text","value":"15. 如图甲水面上有一列浮球。图乙为简化俯视图，所有浮球等间距排成一条直线，水面上的 O 点垂直于水面 xOy 持续沿 z 轴