n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/3048f7200dc29ad0f026ded61e4cf3d5ad7af271fd7c3ba001cedeab6e1a7c2e.png","width":602,"height":316,"width_mm":70.77,"row_group":"gaosan-jinhua-shixiao-2411-q16-row1"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/afcd9c25c8f5ef40612b5cf65bbe3af8973c397825af81b192769750cc606b9c.png","width":478,"height":107,"width_mm":56.07,"row_group":"gaosan-jinhua-shixiao-2411-q16-row1"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/76107097cc1ee0fe13e96fae74a0e1dd368372ffd9dd5e1b9400020c2a8fbfa2.png","width":284,"height":289,"width_mm":33.18,"row_group":"gaosan-jinhua-shixiao-2411-q16-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n丙\n(1)装置中电火花计时器的电源应为（填空）\nA. 直流 220V    B. 交流 220V    C. 交流 8V\n(2)为了平衡摩擦力,将小车连接好纸带。轻推小车后,打出的纸带如图乙所示,纸带的左侧为小车连接处,后续操作正确的是（填空）\nA. 减小小车上钩码的质量 B. 减小槽码的质量 C. 降低垫块高度\n(3)以小车和钩码的总质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"M"},{"type":"text","value":" 为横坐标,加速度的倒数 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{a}"},{"type":"text","value":" 为纵坐标,两同学分别得到的 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{a} - M"},{"type":"text","value":" 图像如图丙所示。由图可知,甲组所用槽码的质量 （填空） (选填“大于”、“小于”或“等于”)乙组槽码的质量。图线与纵坐标的交点表示 （填空） 。\n16-Ⅱ. (5分)如图甲所示为一个自制电容器, 将两张锡箔纸作为两个电极, 三张电容纸作为绝缘介质, 按照一层电容纸、一层锡箔纸的顺序交替叠放, 然后将五层纸一起卷成圆柱形, 两根引线 "},{"type":"math","value":"a, b"},{"type":"text","value":" 分别接在两张锡箔纸上, 最后将整个圆柱形密封在塑料瓶中(两根引线露出),电容器即制作完成。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/c31641f4eacfc18d53fced22fd7d95058db4f708179e2e31079cb5a430860050.png","width":311,"height":183,"width_mm":36.54,"row_group":"gaosan-jinhua-shixiao-2411-q16-row3"},{"type":"text","value":"\n甲\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/c8d3852b7e5472a996393622ec689c39e9160b0fc30b852a34dc0333c6f7eee7.png","width":410,"height":173,"width_mm":48.09,"row_group":"gaosan-jinhua-shixiao-2411-q16-row3"},{"type":"text","value":"\n乙\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/a9637d315c6d0c3b3068393446d63c163638ed2469975692c0c6c8ece74ba72e.png","width":339,"height":292,"width_mm":43.659,"row_group":"gaosan-jinhua-shixiao-2411-q16-row3"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(1)以下哪些操作可以增加该电容器的电容（填空）\nA. 增大电容器的充电电压\n