 引出通道中的磁感应强度 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" ；\n(2)如图乙所示,使用静电偏转法时,粒子被加速到一定速度后从 "},{"type":"math","value":"P'"},{"type":"text","value":" 位置进入磁场,轨道半径恰好与 "},{"type":"math","value":"P'O"},{"type":"text","value":" 的长度相等,均为R。若在粒子到达 "},{"type":"math","value":"P'"},{"type":"text","value":" 位置时安装“静电偏转器MN(MN间距离忽略不计,可看作狭缝)”,两极板构成的圆弧形狭缝圆心为 "},{"type":"math","value":"Q'"},{"type":"text","value":" 、圆心角为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\alpha"},{"type":"text","value":" 。仅在M、N狭缝中加上电场强度为E的电场,粒子恰能通过狭缝,通过狭缝后继续在磁场中运动并在再次加速前射出磁场。求磁场区域的最大半径 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n(3)实际使用中,加速电压如图丙所示,其中 "},{"type":"math","value":"T=\\frac{2\\pi m}{qB}"},{"type":"text","value":" ,且磁感应强度 B 会出现波动,若在 "},{"type":"math","value":"t=\\frac{T}{4}"},{"type":"text","value":" 时粒子第一次被加速,要实现连续 n 次加速(粒子在电场中的加速时间忽略不计),求磁感应强度的最大值与最小值。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/2d7e349490f249e246102fc00a29eedf4aaf3bbfb955437eb0b2e42dccb02666.png","width":342,"height":355,"width_mm":40.11,"row_group":"gaosan-jinhua-shixiao-2411-q20-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n甲\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/72ad8bd59cd6beb7ce0844a7464f6ec3d7ab5be9193a9bce7c54179e1e9a092f.png","width":351,"height":342,"width_mm":41.16,"row_group":"gaosan-jinhua-shixiao-2411-q20-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n乙\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/42d20ad0d21005a9f0ad9e82ffd6ae71ca6bc11c9035f2a40f5dca0fa1227b07.png","width":399,"height":307,"width_mm":46.83,"row_group":"gaosan-jinhua-shixiao-2411-q20-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n丙"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"20.(11分) (1)"},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":". 根据已知"},{"type":"math","value":"qvB = m\\frac{v^2}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)，"},{"type":"math","value":"v = \\frac{qBR}{m}"},{"type":"math","value":"nqU_0 = \\frac{1}{2} mv^2"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Rightarrow n = \\frac{qB^2R^2}{2mU_0}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"},{